<title>FRANCE: Ecco shares suspended pending buyout.</title>
<headline>Ecco shares suspended pending buyout.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Ecco were suspended on Tuesday pending a buyout following previously announced plans by the company to merge with Adia of Switzerland, the French stockmarkets association SBF said in a statement.</p>
<p>The companies said in August that 98 percent of Ecco's shares had been tendered for either cash or a share exchange.</p>
<p>They said shares in the new merged entity, Adecco, will be listed in U.S., Swiss and French markets in the place of Adia and Ecco shares.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
